<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AMLC Beef Weekly - Australian export prices.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AMLC Beef Weekly - Australian export prices.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Meat and Livestock Corp's (AMLC) weekly export prices are as follows:</p>
<p>AUSTRALIAN EXPORT PRICES TO U.S. IN U.S. CENTS/LB, CIF.</p>
<p>    Bull	(95 Chemical Lean)	 81     +1  on last week</p>
<p>    Cow	 (90 CL)			78     -1</p>
<p>    Cow	 (85 CL)			75     +1</p>
<p>    Shank     (90 CL)			75     +1</p>
<p>    Trimmings (85 CL)			72     -1</p>
<p>		  (80 CL)			67     -2</p>
<p>		  (75 CL)			64     -1c</p>
<p>    Chucks    (85 CL)			76     +2</p>
<p>AUSTRALIAN EXPORT PRICES TO JAPAN IN U.S. CENTS/LB CIF.</p>
<p>    Chilled grassfed fullsets	   146     +1  on last week</p>
<p>    Chilled grassfed loin:striploin   233     n/c</p>
<p>				  cube roll   290     n/c</p>
<p>				 tender loin  560     n/c</p>
<p>    Frozen Chuck/blade		     95     +2</p>
<p>    Frozen Thick flank		    104     +1</p>
<p>    Frozen Fore/hind blended	     81     +1</p>
<p>    Frozen Topside			  108     -2</p>
<p>    Frozen Silverside		     100     +2</p>
<p>    Frozen Brisket			   88    n/c</p>
